    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The terms of use of the Cairn.info platform, which publishes French-language SSH journals and books. Not a standard open licence but the publisher's own conditions, normalised from the "Cairn" value that Isidore, HAL and BASE send.</rdfs:comment>
